{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56498","headline":"法师昇高座咏 · 朱君绪","name":"法师昇高座咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"弟子仰法师，敢啓有所陈。\n衆生闇塞久，思闻至法音。\n大慈开长夜，设化万劫新。\n主人建福斋，延及四辈人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱君绪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56498.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56498","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}